{"availability":"available","full":"patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro","name":"quasar-dashboard-pro","description":"A modern, production-ready dashboard template built with Quasar Framework, Vue 3, TypeScript, and Vite.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Vue","stars":22,"forks":5,"created":"2021-07-26T12:47:37Z","updated":"2026-10-05T17:10:25Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://quasar-dashboard-pro.netlify.app","topics":["dashboard","quasar-framework","vue3","vuejs"],"demo":"https://quasar-dashboard-pro.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:01.096Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:01.096Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:01.096Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:01.096Z","stars":22,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A free, open source admin dashboard template built with Vue 3, Quasar 2 and TypeScript. Polished, business-ready UI you can drop straight into a real product — not another empty starter kit.","🇧🇷 Leia em Português · 🇺🇸 English (this file)","Most free admin dashboards are a pile of unrelated demo pages. Quasar Dashboard PRO is organized as ready-to-use business modules — Finance, CRM, E-Commerce, Fleet Tracking, Support, Security Ops, Crypto — each with real, connected flows (not just isolated screens), so you can delete what you don't need and ship the rest."],"features":["Business modules, not demo pages — Finance, CRM, E-Commerce, Fleet Tracking, Support, Security Ops and Crypto, each a self-contained, copy-pasteable folder.","Real UI flows — a full checkout funnel, a kanban you can drag deals across, an inbox with a reading pane, a live map with animated vehicle tracking, a live chat inbox with conversation routing, a world threat map — not…","Common utility pages included — CRUD example, file manager, invoice, FAQ, contact form — so you're not building the boring-but-necessary pages from scratch either.","Modern stack, done right — Vue 3 , Quasar 2, TypeScript everywhere, Pinia, Vite. No Options API, no JavaScript-only leftovers.","A design system, not just components — one accent color, one corner radius, one detail-dialog pattern, applied consistently across every module."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"7a6921414744560dd7acd2f4b2a1fecd170fb0ce7e19979da7250006d6dbbd0e","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:01.188Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:01.188Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A free, open source admin dashboard template built with Vue 3, Quasar 2 and TypeScript. Polished, business-ready UI you can drop straight into a real product — not another empty starter kit.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The dashboard is open by default — no forced login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A demo authentication flow (persisted session, route guard) is included and easy to re-enable, at /login","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Leaflet-powered map with custom markers and geofenced risk zones — no API key required","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"7a6921414744560dd7acd2f4b2a1fecd170fb0ce7e19979da7250006d6dbbd0e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:01.189Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T17:10:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patrickmonteiro/quasar-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:0